Packet timeshift: do not deliver a packet already freed on skip to live.
Rewinding, then going back to live, aborted tvheadend (double free of the
pending packet on SMT_SKIP_LIVE).  Independent of 112/113.

tvheadend/tvheadend#2249, commit 377f86591 (branch record-from-buffer, on master 2e64ec02c).

--- src/timeshift/timeshift_reader.c.orig
+++ src/timeshift/timeshift_reader.c
@@ -671,6 +671,7 @@ void *timeshift_reader ( void *p )
                 /* Release */
                 if (sm)
                   streaming_msg_free(sm);
+                sm = NULL;
 
                 /* Find end */
                 skip_time = 0x7fffffffffffffffLL;
